      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If you lack confidence, build up your\r\nstrength first. The Cancel Quest\r\noption lets you wipe the slate\r\nclean anytime.",
        "Jp" : "腕に自信が無ければ、力を蓄えてからにしろ\r\nキャンセルしたければ《クエスト破棄》で\r\nいつでも無かったことにしてもいいんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 483227,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Don't worry, I won't withdraw the\r\nrequest. Everything has its proper\r\ntime—and judging that moment\r\nis your call to make.",
        "Jp" : "なに、俺も依頼も逃げやしない\r\n何事にもタイミングってのがあるからな\r\nもちろん、それを見極めるのはお前自身だ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 483228,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
