      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What you need to do is the same as last time: \r\ninvestigate the treasure chest in the deepest part. \r\nIt's become such a routine by now, \r\nyou probably had a hunch, right?",
        "Jp" : "やることは前回と同じで、最奥の宝箱の調査だ\r\nもうお決まりのパターンになってるから\r\nお前も薄々予感してただろ？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 471632,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
